$DATUM 110-54-3
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Olefination with N,N'-dimethylphosphonamide (R)-21a, addition of AcOH at
room temperature (Table 2, entry 2). To a solution of phosphonamide
(R)-21a (3.4 g, 10.6 mmol) in THF (30 mL) was added n-BuLi (5.6 mL of a
1.6 M solution in hexanes, 8.96 mmol) at -78 °C. The mixture was stirred
for two hours at -78 °C, then ketone 17 (800 mg, 4.76 mmol) was added to
it. The reaction mixture was stirred for one hour at -78 °C, after which
it was allowed to warm to room temperature, AcOH (3.0 mL) was added, and
stirring continued for another 20 min. After addition of saturated NaHCO3
solution and extraction with CH2Cl2, the combined organic phase was dried
and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by flash
chromatography (hexanes: Et2O, 10:1 to 4:1). (E/Z = 6:1 by 1H NMR). As
second fraction, 220 mg of ketone 17 (28%) was recovered. Analytical pure
samples of the TBS-olefins were obtained by flash chromatography
(hexanes: Et2O, 100:1 to 20:1); The E/Z ratio was determined by 1H NMR
analysis of the crude reaction mixture. 1.01 g (62%) of an E/Z-mixture of
TBS-olefins 24a as a colorless oil. Z -24 was obtained as the first
fraction and E-24 as the second one. tert-Butyl((S, Z)-4-((2R,
6R)-6-ethyl-5-methyl-3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)-2-methylpent-3-enyloxy)dimethylsilane
Z-24a was obtained as a colorless oil. tert-Butyl((S, E)-4-((2R,
6R)-6-ethyl-5-methyl-3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)-2-methylpent-
3-enyloxy)dimethylsilane5a E-24 a was obtained as a colorless oil.
tert-Butyl((S, Z)-4-((2R,
6R)-6-ethyl-5-methyl-3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)-2-methylpent-3-enyloxy)dimethylsilane
Z-24a: 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 5.62-5.58 (m, 1H), 4.99 (d, J = 9.9 Hz,
1H), 4.39 (dd, J = 10.7, 3.1 Hz, 1H), 4.11 (br s, 1H), 3.52 (dd, J = 9.7,
5.5 Hz, 1H), 3.33 (dd, J = 9.7, 7.8 Hz, 1H), 2.69-2.58 (m, 1H), 2.30-2.18
(m, 1H), 1.81-1.70 (m, 5H), 1.61 (br s, 3H), 1.59-1.50 (m, 1H), 0.94 (d,
J = 6.7 Hz, 3H), 0.91 (s, 9H), 0.89 (d, J = 7.3 Hz, 3H), 0.05 (s, 6H).
13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 136.6, 135.2, 129.2, 121.0, 77.5, 72.1, 67.9,
34.8, 29.6, 25.9, 25.6, 19.0, 18.5, 18.4, 17.8, 8.1, -5.3, -5.4. IR
(film, NaCl) 2958, 2929, 2896, 2857, 1463, 1471, 1454, 1380, 1255, 1107,
1086, 1053, 1032, 837, 775 cm-1.[α]20 D +22.7° (c 1.29, CHCl3). MS (ESI)
calcd for C20H39O2Si (M+H)+: 339.3, found 339.2. tert-Butyl((S,
E)-4-((2R, 6R)-6-ethyl-5-methyl-3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)-2-methylpent-
3-enyloxy)dimethylsilane5a E-24 a: 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 5.61-5.57
(m, 1H), 5.23 (d, J = 9.3 Hz, 1H), 4.12 (br s, 1H), 3.85 (dd, J = 10.7,
2.8 Hz, 1H), 3.47 (dd, J = 9.7, 6.0 Hz, 1H), 3.37 (dd, J = 9.7, 7.4 Hz,
1H), 2.66-2.54 (m, 1H), 2.19-2.08 (m, 1H), 1.93-1.84 (m, 1H), 1.84-1.72
(m, 1H), 1.62-1.60 (m, 3H), 1.70 (d, J = 1.17 Hz, 3H), 1.60-1.50 (m, 1H),
0.99 (d, J = 6.7 Hz, 3H), 0.92 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 3H), 0.91 (s, 9H), 0.053
(s, 3H), 0.05 (s, 3H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 136.3, 135.1, 128.0,
121.0, 77.94, 77.9, 67.8, 35.0, 30.1, 25.9, 25.6, 19.0, 18.3, 17.2, 12.6,
8.2, -5.3, -5.4. IR (film, NaCl) 2958, 2929, 2895, 2856, 1471, 1462,
1255, 1118, 1091, 1051, 1030, 836, 774, 665 cm-1.[α]20 D +47.7° (c 1.37,
CHCl3). MS (ESI) calcd for C20H39O2Si (M+H)+: 339.3, found 339.2.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, Horner-Wadsworth-Emmons reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Total Synthesis of Jerangolid A
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Hanessian, Stephen; Focken, Thilo; Oza, Rupal
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
